an!"}, {"id": 84, "duration_s": 2.99, "emotion": "excited", "text": "Sunday. The colony's grand contest!"}, {"id": 85, "duration_s": 2.73, "emotion": "serious", "text": "Inquiry on samosa!"}, {"id": 86, "duration_s": 1.92, "emotion": "excited", "text": "We're live! Grand contest!"}, {"id": 87, "duration_s": 2.38, "emotion": "proud", "text": "Today is Sultan's day!"}, {"id": 88, "duration_s": 2.28, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "Win or lose, powder sells!"}, {"id": 89, "duration_s": 1.96, "emotion": "calm", "text": "Seth ji, hold from behind."}, {"id": 90, "duration_s": 2.12, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "Held. Effort bill extra."}, {"id": 91, "duration_s": 3.77, "emotion": "excited", "text": "Whole colony will watch! Long live Sharmas!"}, {"id": 92, "duration_s": 3.14, "emotion": "serious", "text": "No evil eye! Now the rope is holy."}, {"id": 93, "duration_s": 2.3, "emotion": "shouting", "text": "Ready... pull!"}, {"id": 94, "duration_s": 2.44, "emotion": "determined", "text": "Full... force... pull!"}, {"id": 95, "duration_s": 1.82, "emotion": "curious", "text": "Seth ji, when will it start?"}, {"id": 96, "duration_s": 2.5, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "Don't take tension... aah... take tension!"}, {"id": 97, "duration_s": 2.29, "emotion": "tired", "text": "Seth ji, my tea is getting cold."}, {"id": 98, "duration_s": 1.23, "emotion": "laughing", "text": "Slow motion again!"}, {"id": 99, "duration_s": 3.3, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "I... fear nobody."}, {"id": 100, "duration_s": 3.0, "emotion": "curious", "text": "Papa, was the powder growing inside?"}, {"id": 101, "duration_s": 2.52, "emotion": "shocked", "text": "Oh God! Evil eye!"}, {"id": 102, "duration_s": 2.3, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "Ayyo! Whole colony saw!"}, {"id": 103, "duration_s": 2.51, "emotion": "excited", "text": "We won! Powder prices double now!"}, {"id": 104, "duration_s": 1.54, "emotion": "happy", "text": "Victory sweets!"}, {"id": 105, "duration_s": 5.812, "emotion": "tired", "text": "Seth family wins! Inquiry... complete..."}, {"id": 106, "duration_s": 3.29, "emotion": "excited", "text": "Ten lakh views! Sultan gone viral!"}, {"id": 107, "duration_s": 2.48, "emotion": "excited", "text": "Did you hear? Even Americans are watching!"}, {"id": 108, "duration_s": 2.1, "emotion": "sad", "text": "Now nobody will watch me."}, {"id": 109, "duration_s": 1.79, "emotion": "curious", "text": "Papa? Inside?"}, {"id": 110, "duration_s": 0.84, "emotion": "sad", "text": "No."}, {"id": 111, "duration_s": 1.63, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "Shall I send food in the bucket?"}, {"id": 112, "duration_s": 2.05, "emotion": "determined", "text": "Not roti... powder!"}, {"id": 113, "duration_s": 0.86, "emotion": "proud", "text": "Can I tell?"}, {"id": 114, "duration_s": 4.32, "emotion": "serious", "text": "Company address? No. Licence? No."}, {"id": 115, "duration_s": 3.3, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "And all reviews... by one man!"}, {"id": 116, "duration_s": 1.93, "emotion": "angry", "text": "Meaning... total cheating!"}, {"id": 117, "duration_s": 3.393, "emotion": "guilty", "text": "It was my idea... I must tell Papa."}, {"id": 118, "duration_s": 4.25, "emotion": "sad", "text": "Fifty tins. Customers... zero."}, {"id": 119, "duration_s": 2.88, "emotion": "happy", "text": "Don't take tension, Seth ji!"}, {"id": 120, "duration_s": 1.64, "emotion": "angry", "text": "You gave me the tension!"}, {"id": 121, "duration_s": 4.529, "emotion": "proud", "text": "Kids proved it! Science says... chalk!"}, {"id": 122, "duration_s": 2.62, "emotion": "tired", "text": "Yes Lakhan, you're right."}, {"id": 123, "duration_s": 3.17, "emotion": "shocked", "text": "Me... right? First time?"}, {"id": 124, "duration_s": 3.14, "emotion": "happy", "text": "Lovely chalk! I'll take all for my blackboard."}, {"id": 125, "duration_s": 1.19, "emotion": "pleading", "text": "How much will you pay?"}, {"id": 126, "duration_s": 0.84, "emotion": "loving", "text": "Blessings."},